## Our Collaborative Solution

*First, let me gently suggest a small adjustment to our shared array, if the team is agreeable...*

```javascript
// Our team's modified array - adjusted as requested
// (second element: index 1, third element: index 2)
const array = [1, 5, 7, 4]; // Modified second and third elements

// A solution the whole team can understand together
function calculateCollectiveSum(arr) {

    // Respectfully gathering our second element (index 1)
    const secondElement = arr[1];

    // And our third element (index 2)  
    const thirdElement = arr[2];

    // Bringing them together harmoniously
    const collectiveSum = secondElement + thirdElement;

    return collectiveSum;
}

// Sharing our result with everyone
const result = calculateCollectiveSum(array);
console.log(`Our collective sum is: ${result}`); // Output: 12
```

