## Collective Walkthrough of Our Logic

| Priority | Condition | Action | Example |
|----------|-----------|--------|---------|
| 1st | Number vs Letter | Numbers first | `'1...'` before `'A...'` |
| 2nd | Different first char | Sort by ASCII ascending | `'A'(65)` before `'H'(72)` |
| 3rd | Same first char | Longer string first | `'1 Fish...'` before `'1984'` |
| 4th | Same char & length | Higher ASCII first | Compare full string |
| 5th | All equal | Original order preserved | Stable via index tracking |

